# Every pull request automatically requests review from the owners below.
# With "Require review from Code Owners" on in the main ruleset, one owner must approve.
#
# Replace @your-org/python-team and @your-org/python-team-leads with your own GitHub
# teams (see docs/github-setup.md). Later lines win, so the catch-all comes first.

*                             @your-org/python-team

# One line per project: the people who own its jobs review its changes.
# The tests fail if a project in projects/ has no line here.
/projects/example-project/    @your-org/python-team

# CI, deployment and security changes get a second pair of eyes from the leads.
/.github/                     @your-org/python-team-leads
/deploy/                      @your-org/python-team-leads
/SECURITY.md                  @your-org/python-team-leads
